      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشايعت الإِبِلُ</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشايعوا</span> is from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشِّيعَةُ</span>, (S, O,) and signifies <i>They became</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَع</span>
[i. e. <i>separate parties,</i> &amp;c., pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيعَةٌ</span>, q. v.].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>They went,</i> or <i>went along, together.</i>
(KL.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  [See also the part. n., voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَيِّعٌ</span>.]

